## 17. Your First Experiment

Now modify your program.

Change:

```go
fmt.Println("Hello, World!")
```

to:

```go
fmt.Println("My name is Saket")
```

Run:

```bash
go run main.go
```

You should get:

```text
My name is Saket
```

Now change it to:

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func main() {
    fmt.Println("My name is Saket")
    fmt.Println("I am learning Go")
    fmt.Println("Go is fun")
}
```

Run it.

Expected output:

```text
My name is Saket
I am learning Go
Go is fun
```

Notice something important:

```go
fmt.Println(...)
fmt.Println(...)
fmt.Println(...)
```

are three separate statements.

